          <zone fixed-size='153' forceUpdate='true' h='12184' id='14' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98756' x='622' y='1189'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>The third dashboard, titled &quot;Review &amp; Availability Effect,&quot; examines how the frequency of reviews and the availability of listings affect their performance. It investigates whether listings with more reviews per month tend to have higher prices or better visibility, and whether availability throughout the year influences a listing’s success. By analyzing these factors together, this dashboard aims to uncover whether there is a meaningful relationship between host responsiveness, listing openness, and guest engagement.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
