                <zone fixed-size='139' forceUpdate='true' h='21843' id='13' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='43468' x='55910' y='1189'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The first dashboard, titled &quot;Total View,&quot; presents an overview of Airbnb listings across New York City. It features a map where each listing is represented by a circle, with the size of the circle corresponding to the total price, allowing users to quickly identify high-priced areas. Alongside the map, a bar chart shows the number of listings per borough, with Manhattan and Brooklyn clearly standing out as the areas with the highest concentration of listings. Users can interact with filters for neighborhood and room type, and the color scale at the bottom displays the range of median prices to give an idea of affordability.</run>
