                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>The second dashboard, titled &quot;Most Expensive!,&quot; focuses on identifying the highest-priced hosts in the dataset. A bar chart ranks hosts by their total listing price, revealing that corporate or professional hosts such as Sonder (NYC) and Blueground dominate the high-end market. Below this, another chart shows the number of listings by room type, indicating that entire home or apartment listings are the most common and typically associated with higher prices. The visualizations are enhanced by color coding that differentiates neighborhoods, helping users see which areas the most expensive listings are located in.</run>
